<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses import duties unchanged.</title>
<headline>EU molasses import duties unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday left molasses import duties unchanged from the previous week, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The reference prices were ajusted but there was no change to import duty rates,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The duty for cane molasses was set at the ordinary rate of 0.41 ecus per 100 kg based on a reference price of 7.42 ecus per 100 kg up from 7.33 ecus the previous week.</p>
<p>The duty for beet molasses remains suspended at zero, based on a reference price of 11.55 ecus per 100 kg up from 11.40 the previous week.</p>
</text>
